{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For the numbers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/c/00cbe98d2864aae78c25b55b49ae5482c8a50e2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d, e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" /> define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> to be the arithmetic mean of all five numbers; \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> to be the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />; <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" /> to be the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/5/645be08e4819218ce9af911a12d44623643dcf77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c, d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />; \nand <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/f/36f73fc1312ee0349b3f3a0f3bd9eb5504339011.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> to be the arithmetic mean of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/2/9b25f8e64b484493fda944d25cad453423041fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l$\" width=\"5\" height=\"12\" />. Then, no matter how <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42c06de735d79f0b28c30bcbbcf96e67bb1ca42c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c, d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3a59bb1293ee3f6dec19de4019a7178874219ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> are chosen, we shall always have: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/c/9cc841c5f99b608428cefe17244e966acd473cfc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ m = p \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ m \\ge p \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ m &gt; p \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D) }\\ m &lt; p\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We shall begin by eliminating some options through counterexamples. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/1/ac12d8f468b277d422a1b278d45db72967ac6ed0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c=d=e$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"142\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87ddb1aa6c1aff0838bdb1ca92d62a73fb01d2d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=k=l=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"116\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/f/09f7fa9e3f9f866ccb309bbe147eb30b19b675b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"45\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a07ccbb6f446bd3ddd9b870c17f10cf188e5399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"11\" />. Answers (C) and (D) do not allow for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/0/3a07ccbb6f446bd3ddd9b870c17f10cf188e5399.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"11\" />, so they can be eliminated. If we set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e3cbfdcb4acd5efa631f25e5e5bf6334d1e1194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"54\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/3/373a44c9da0603257edabb4668fa1e43b56ca3c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=c=d=e=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/d/2dda80bd4f83db6b8ae1515c299c98ac3083af6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/e/cee73b210177887641d857cf5887cb75479ec501.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=30$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/6/f5644099294a33bf6ea99f64e0eba8cb70bbc020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$l=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/6/d765b086a3d3ad343126b2834428fe76c6f6e146.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$p=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" />. Here, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/c/e8c1991fdc6403e4d7ad09ab72269a0e6fe5e7ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m&lt;p$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" />, so we can throw out options (A) and (B) as well. Now, we are left with only option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/2/af254ecda305646a99dea2cadffd6f9ecc74945f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(E) }none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"142\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">Problem 25</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=